  "limitations": [
    "The browser uses the production Vite build and real read-only FastAPI catalog/detail routes at the configured loopback origin. This catalog-only factory does not compose runtime services; only its exact known approvals and status-summary 503 Problem Details and matching browser resource errors are accepted, one-for-one. Other errors and warnings fail.",
    "Component tests use the existing generic hierarchy fixture. Canonical source role IDs and all fourteen real detail responses are qualified separately by the desktop/mobile browser journeys; no API response replacement is introduced.",
    "Chromium viewport emulation at 1536x1024 and 426x923 does not qualify physical devices, other browser engines or operating-system screen readers. Existing responsive and accessibility regression runners remain included.",
    "The graph preserves its compact overview geometry and existing title/accessible-description fallback for ellipsized runtime labels. Complete ordinal chips and department summaries must fit their containing boxes.",
    "All browser requests remain under the existing same-origin network guard. No provider, connector, credential, real delivery or application mutation is involved; CI remains disabled. Final committed-tree gates and external attestation are required before merge."
  ]
